  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASSIST GOJ IN ITS POVERTY ALLEVIATION EFFORTS BY ESTABLISHING A SOCIAL INVESTMENT FUND TO:(A)DEVELOP AN EFFICIENT, DEMAND-DRIVEN AND COMPLEMENTARY MECHANISM TO DELIVER BASIC SERVICES AND INFRASTRUCTURE TO THE POOR; (B) DEVELOP AND DEMOSTRATE TRANSPARENT AND EFFICIENT APPROACHES TO PROJECT SELECTION, MANAGEMENT AND ADMINISTRATION; AND (C) STRENGTHEN THE INSTITUTIONAL CAPACITY OF NGOS AND COMMUNITY-BASED ORGANIZATIONS.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES"></narrative>
  </description>
